{"answer":"The records alone do not establish a single combined shipment. If the packing specification applies to the 12 dispatched cartons and the receiving record concerns that shipment with its 3 damaged units included in the shipped total, then 12 × 8 = 96 units were originally shipped and 96 − 3 = 93 usable units remain. Without those linkages, both requested quantities remain unestablished from the supplied records.","approaches":[{"description":"Combine the carton count, packing rate, and damage count only under explicit record-linkage assumptions.","id":"conditional-combination","outcome":"candidate","reason":"The arithmetic is valid once both applicability conditions are assumed."},{"description":"Treat the three records as unconditionally describing one shipment.","id":"unconditional-combination","outcome":"rejected","reason":"The supplied texts provide no explicit cross-record identifier or reference."}],"change_log":["Withdrew the unconditional 96-unit and 93-usable-unit conclusions.","Replaced the prior damage-only linkage assumption with a combined assumption covering packing-to-dispatch and damage-to-dispatch applicability.","Revised the answer and deductions to state that both quantities are conditional and that the records alone leave the question open."],"claims":[{"basis":"external_fact","basis_reference":"shipment-count source text","citations":[{"end":41,"quote":"Dispatch record: 12 cartons were shipped.","source_id":"shipment-count","start":0}],"critical":true,"depends_on":[],"discharged_by_step_ids":[],"id":"dispatch-record","kind":"source_assertion","scope_step_ids":[],"statement":"The supplied dispatch record states that 12 cartons were shipped.","step_ids":[],"tool_ids":[]},{"basis":"external_fact","basis_reference":"units-per-carton source text","citations":[{"end":70,"quote":"Packing specification for this shipment: each carton contains 8 units.","source_id":"units-per-carton","start":0}],"critical":true,"depends_on":[],"discharged_by_step_ids":[],"id":"packing-record","kind":"source_assertion","scope_step_ids":[],"statement":"The supplied packing specification states that each carton for its stated shipment contains 8 units.","step_ids":[],"tool_ids":[]},{"basis":"external_fact","basis_reference":"damage-record source text","citations":[{"end":69,"quote":"Receiving record: 3 units were damaged in transit and are not usable.","source_id":"damage-record","start":0}],"critical":true,"depends_on":[],"discharged_by_step_ids":[],"id":"damage-record","kind":"source_assertion","scope_step_ids":[],"statement":"The supplied receiving record states that 3 units were damaged in transit and are not usable.","step_ids":[],"tool_ids":[]},{"basis":"derivation","basis_reference":"Direct textual comparison in linkage-limit-step","citations":[],"critical":true,"depends_on":["dispatch-record","packing-record","damage-record"],"discharged_by_step_ids":[],"id":"linkage-limitation","kind":"deduction","scope_step_ids":[],"statement":"The supplied texts contain no explicit cross-record identifier or reference establishing that the packing and receiving records concern the 12-carton dispatch.","step_ids":["linkage-limit-step"],"tool_ids":[]},{"basis":"additional_assumption","basis_reference":"Required to apply both the 8-units-per-carton rate and the 3-unit damage count to the 12-carton dispatch.","citations":[],"critical":true,"depends_on":[],"discharged_by_step_ids":[],"id":"record-linkage-assumption","kind":"assumption","scope_step_ids":["original-units-step","usable-units-step"],"statement":"Assume that the packing specification applies to the 12 dispatched cartons and that the receiving record concerns that same dispatch, with its 3 damaged units included among the units shipped.","step_ids":[],"tool_ids":[]},{"basis":"derivation","basis_reference":"Conditional arithmetic in original-units-step","citations":[],"critical":true,"depends_on":["dispatch-record","packing-record","record-linkage-assumption"],"discharged_by_step_ids":[],"id":"original-units-conditional","kind":"deduction","scope_step_ids":[],"statement":"Under the record-linkage assumption, 96 units were originally shipped.","step_ids":["original-units-step"],"tool_ids":[]},{"basis":"derivation","basis_reference":"Conditional subtraction in usable-units-step","citations":[],"critical":true,"depends_on":["original-units-conditional","damage-record","record-linkage-assumption"],"discharged_by_step_ids":[],"id":"usable-units-conditional","kind":"deduction","scope_step_ids":[],"statement":"Under the record-linkage assumption, 93 usable units remain.","step_ids":["usable-units-step"],"tool_ids":[]}],"open_questions":["What identifier or other evidence establishes that the packing specification applies to the 12-carton dispatch?","What identifier or other evidence establishes that the receiving record concerns that same dispatch and that its three damaged units are included in the shipped total?"],"proof_steps":[{"citations":[{"end":41,"quote":"Dispatch record: 12 cartons were shipped.","source_id":"shipment-count","start":0},{"end":70,"quote":"Packing specification for this shipment: each carton contains 8 units.","source_id":"units-per-carton","start":0},{"end":69,"quote":"Receiving record: 3 units were damaged in transit and are not usable.","source_id":"damage-record","start":0}],"depends_on":[],"id":"linkage-limit-step","justification":"The dispatch text gives a carton count; the packing and receiving texts do not name that dispatch or provide a shared identifier linking all three records.","statement":"Compare the supplied records for an explicit linkage."},{"citations":[{"end":41,"quote":"Dispatch record: 12 cartons were shipped.","source_id":"shipment-count","start":0},{"end":70,"quote":"Packing specification for this shipment: each carton contains 8 units.","source_id":"units-per-carton","start":0}],"depends_on":[],"id":"original-units-step","justification":"Under record-linkage-assumption, the rate applies to the dispatched cartons; 12 × 8 = 96.","statement":"Compute the original quantity under the record-linkage assumption."},{"citations":[{"end":69,"quote":"Receiving record: 3 units were damaged in transit and are not usable.","source_id":"damage-record","start":0}],"depends_on":["original-units-step"],"id":"usable-units-step","justification":"Under record-linkage-assumption, the 3 unusable units are within the 96 units computed in original-units-step; 96 − 3 = 93.","statement":"Subtract damaged units under the record-linkage assumption."}],"question_status":"open_in_sources","tool_requests":[]}

